{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/SidMenonTM/status/2103169764244017396","id":"2103169764244017396","text":"Last night I asked Opus 5.5 to make a short claymation in Blender, and told it the story should be about itself.\nIt came back with an owl who works the night shift at a post office, answering letters from everyone. Then one letter asks about him.\nClaude wrote it, designed the set and the clerk, rigged and animated him entirely through code, rendered it frame by frame on a tiny cloud machine, and synthesised the music box score. My notes were: more clay, darker lighting, put the text over the picture, slow fade at the end. The rest was me typing \"continue.\"\nThe Night Post. Written and directed by Claude.","raw_text":{"text":"Last night I asked Opus 5.5 to make a short claymation in Blender, and told it the story should be about itself.\nIt came back with an owl who works the night shift at a post office, answering letters from everyone. Then one letter asks about him.\nClaude wrote it, designed the set and the clerk, rigged and animated him entirely through code, rendered it frame by frame on a tiny cloud machine, and synthesised the music box score. My notes were: more clay, darker lighting, put the text over the picture, slow fade at the end. The rest was me typing \"continue.\"\nThe Night Post. Written and directed by Claude.","display_text_range":[0,610],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[281,304],"id":"2103169696476618752","display":"pic.x.com/0k7KR29htP","original":"https://t.co/0k7KR29htP","replacement":"https://x.com/SidMenonTM/status/2103169764244017396/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"SidMenonTM","url":"https://x.com/SidMenonTM","id":"887935469287129089","followers":35,"following":112,"likes":83,"media_count":27,"name":"Sid","description":"Siddhartha Menon - Head of Mission @miracles_tiny | Building AI for real social impact | Houseboat experiment ongoing | Bombay → Amsterdam","raw_description":{"text":"Siddhartha Men